From 724a799bd04382732df8ba73611b4a2702879ac6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AIExplorer7 <341304285+AIExplorer7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:31:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add optimized fused FP8 x MXFP4 MegaMoE for SM90

Derive the fused SM90 framework from PR #440 (8cf8180) and build on
PR #411 (5d32216, referencing Humming) for MXFP4 format and decoding.

Add tiled register decoding, specialized RS WGMMA buckets and direct
swap epilogues, MXFP4 split-M and tail paths, and optional split-K.
Adapt the required fused infrastructure to nv_dev DeepJIT while
preserving existing non-fused API defaults.

Include correctness tests and H20 four-way Graph benchmarks against
PRs #383, #411, and #440 for Flash/Pro at M=1 through 8192.
